WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:05.600
Let's edit our first page in Hacks.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.000
To edit this content,

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.240
we click the pencil at the top.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:13.320
A panel opens up. In this case, it's

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.720
showing us our blocks that we have.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:16.960
You can also see that there's the

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:20.640
structure of the current page,

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:24.920
the source that's powering this page,

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.840
and this grayed out area, which will be

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:28.720
for settings.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.200
So,

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:32.800
when we select something in the body of

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.320
content in Hacks, in this case a

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:37.520
heading, we see the settings tab open up

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:39.160
with heading,

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.560
and then we can modify settings related

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:45.400
to the heading.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.000
We could lock the heading, and there's

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.160
even support for more advanced developer

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.520
types of settings.

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:54.120
Most people, though, are going to stick

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:57.600
to what's under configure.

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:01.040
Type, I just enter

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:02.240
typing,

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:03.920
or

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:05.760
delete. I can do any number of

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:11.440
operations on the text bar here.

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:12.880
When I start typing, the bar will go

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.000
away,

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.040
and when I pause, it will come back.

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:18.960
If I want to change it from a paragraph

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:21.240
to a different type of block element, I

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:23.960
can do that via this tab.

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:25.960
Then, we save.
